{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_013jc45jZ1yWTtfUUkRyJ1B9","type":"tool_result","content":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Scoring Criteria - Not Provided\n\nBased on the document provided, **specific reviewer scoring criteria and rating scales are not included** in the \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers.\"\n\nThe document outlines the review process structure but does not detail numerical scales or specific scoring dimensions. It mentions that:\n\n- Two human reviews in Phase 1 will be \"supplemented by an additional AI-generated review\"\n- The AI review will contain \"no ratings or recommendations\"\n- Human reviewers will provide ratings, but the exact scale definitions are absent from this page\n\nThe guidelines focus on qualitative review practices—such as assessing whether \"the story of the paper is clear\" and evaluating if \"empirical results really support the claims\"—rather than providing numbered scoring rubrics.\n\n**To access the complete scoring criteria**, you would need to consult the actual submission/review platform or the comprehensive Author Kit at https://aaai.org/authorkit26/, which likely contains the full review form specifications and rating scales."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"44955cf6-fbf6-481a-ac64-bdae83b1911e","uuid":"8f66f393-8a5a-4e5e-9cfd-c87d94888386","timestamp":"2026-05-21T13:37:08.570Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":204307,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# AAAI-26 Reviewer Scoring Criteria - Not Provided\n\nBased on the document provided, **specific reviewer scoring criteria and rating scales are not included** in the \"Instructions for AAAI-26 Reviewers.\"\n\nThe document outlines the review process structure but does not detail numerical scales or specific scoring dimensions. It mentions that:\n\n- Two human reviews in Phase 1 will be \"supplemented by an additional AI-generated review\"\n- The AI review will contain \"no ratings or recommendations\"\n- Human reviewers will provide ratings, but the exact scale definitions are absent from this page\n\nThe guidelines focus on qualitative review practices—such as assessing whether \"the story of the paper is clear\" and evaluating if \"empirical results really support the claims\"—rather than providing numbered scoring rubrics.\n\n**To access the complete scoring criteria**, you would need to consult the actual submission/review platform or the comprehensive Author Kit at https://aaai.org/authorkit26/, which likely contains the full review form specifications and rating scales.","durationMs":5312,"url":"https://aaai.org/conference/aaai/aaai-26/instructions-for-aaai-26-reviewers/"}}
